    {
      "text": "I am the Almighty God, Gen. 17:1 (Rev. 1:8; Hel. 10:11). Is any thing too hard for the Lord, Gen. 18:14. God Almighty bless thee, Gen. 28:3. the Almighty, who shall bless thee, Gen. 49:25. there is no restraint to the Lord, 1 Sam. 14:6. he will deliver me out of the hand of this Philistine, 1 Sam. 17:37. This day will the Lord deliver thee into mine hand, 1 Sam. 17:46. God is my strength and power, 2 Sam. 22:33. there is nothing too hard for thee, Jer. 32:17. He hath made the earth by his power, Jer. 51:15. I will rebuke the devourer for your sakes, Mal. 3:11 (3 Ne. 24:11).",
