    {
      "text": "he arose, and rebuked the winds and the sea, Matt. 8:26. with God all things are possible, Matt. 19:26 (Mark 10:27; Luke 1:37; 18:27). not knowing the scriptures, nor the power of God, Matt. 22:29. All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth, Matt. 28:18 (D&C 93:17). All things were made by him, John 1:3. the Father raiseth up the dead, and quickeneth them, John 5:21. I have power to lay it down … to take it again, John 10:18. God, who quickeneth the dead, Rom. 4:17. he that raised up Christ … shall also quicken your mortal bodies, Rom. 8:11. there is no power but of God, Rom. 13:1. power of God, and the wisdom of God, 1 Cor. 1:24. God, who quickeneth all things, and before Christ, 1 Tim. 6:13. upholding all things by the word of his power, Heb. 1:3. Lord God Almighty, which was, and is, and is to come, Rev. 4:8 (11:17). Lord God omnipotent reigneth, Rev. 19:6. Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are the temple, Rev. 21:22.",
